Z||000017||spike||09-07-2000||04:13 PM||||I have lace mags on my Fiero. They look look the GP wheels (Gold/Silver). I hate them. I have been shopping around for some nice star mags but for the price I want to pay no luck so far. I will probubly keep the ones I have for the Drag strip. They are 3 piece mags made by Simmons. The rear wheels are very wide. I had 255 but switched to 225 due to the amount of tire that sticks out of the wheel well. My mag still sticks out but with the smaller tire it is not as noticable.<P>Tks, Mike.||||reg||1
